content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Owner",
      "description": "Person who commissions and finances the construction project."
    },
    {
      "name": "Design Request",
      "description": "A request from the owner to the architect describing design needs and requirements."
    },
    {
      "name": "Architect",
      "description": "Professional responsible for creating and updating blueprints based on design requests and regulations."
    },
    {
      "name": "Blueprint",
      "description": "Detailed architectural plan that defines the structure and layout of the building."
    },
    {
      "name": "Permit Application",
      "description": "Formal application submitted to the city for approval to begin construction, containing the blueprint.",
      "attributes": [
        "Blueprint"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Construction Permit",
      "description": "Official approval document from the city that authorizes the start of construction."
    },
    {
      "name": "City Officer",
      "description": "Official responsible for reviewing permits and conducting inspections to ensure compliance."
    },
    {
      "name": "Construction Project",
      "description": "Active building project managed by the overseer and executed by workers.",
      "attributes": [
        "Construction Worker",
        "Project Schedule",
        "Blueprint"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Construction Worker",
      "description": "Laborer who carries out construction tasks according to overseer instructions."
    },
    {
      "name": "Project Schedule",
      "description": "Timeline and sequence of construction activities for the project."
    },
    {
      "name": "Inspection",
      "description": "City officer’s evaluation of the construction site for compliance with safety and building standards."
    },
    {
      "name": "Construction Overseer",
      "description": "Manager responsible for executing the project, coordinating workers, and maintaining safety and progress."
    },
    {
      "name": "Safety Concern Report",
      "description": "Notice raised by a worker to report potential hazards or unsafe conditions to the overseer."
    },
    {
      "name": "Instruction",
      "description": "Task or directive given by the overseer to guide worker activities on site."
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Commission": {
      "objects": [
        "Owner",
        "Design Request",
        "Architect",
        "Blueprint",
        "Permit Application"
      ]
    },
    "Construction": {
      "objects": [
        "Construction Overseer",
        "Construction Project",
        "Construction Worker",
        "Project Schedule",
        "Blueprint",
        "Instruction",
        "Safety Concern Report"
      ]
    },
    "Governance": {
      "objects": [
        "City Officer",
        "Inspection",
        "Construction Permit"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- In case an object appears in multiple bounded contexts, suggest a name change.
- Also suggest a name change if the meaning of the object is too similar to an object from another bounded context
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Commission": {
      "derived from": "Commission Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Owner",
        "Design Request",
        "Architect",
        "Blueprint",
        "Permit Application"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Blueprint -> Draft Blueprint"
      ]
    },
    "Construction": {
      "derived from": "Construction Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Construction Overseer",
        "Construction Project",
        "Construction Worker",
        "Project Schedule",
        "Blueprint",
        "Instruction",
        "Safety Concern Report"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Blueprint -> Construction Blueprint"
      ]
    },
    "Governance": {
      "derived from": "Governance Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "City Officer",
        "Inspection",
        "Construction Permit"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    }
  }
}
```
